  "title": "Spotify Expands Family Plan Verification with QR Code",
  "summary": "Spotify co-founder Alex Norström confirmed that the company is launching a new QR code verification method for its Family plan to help users identify who they are, with a focus on ensuring that users who are not actually living together with the plan manager are not subject to premium access. Engadget reports that the initiative aims to increase the effectiveness of the existing Family plan.",
